  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine with Decay D and Tone 04 (medium-bright, long decay), for slower 808-focused electro. The click is the body sine's own start, a fifth of a cycle in, with a 1 ms attack on a steep curve: no edge operator came closer to this recording's onset, so the Square D edge (C) sits at level 0; raised, it adds a step that falls in 1.7 ms. The pitch holds 16 semitones up for 7 ms, drops to 3 and glides over about 200 ms onto 51 Hz on C4; a soft drive with a little bias. Every operator starts at a locked phase. Decay 1.1 s; the hit runs its course whatever the gate.",
